Server init.

>> x := Blob xees: 65 xeetu: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Prograam jamono: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server lëkkale: (
 Jokkalante xees ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Jokkalante xees ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x dale: 0 guddaay: 1), taxaw.
x bàyyi.

